{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":490359,"name":"","username":"mwjt42","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/mwjt42/{size}/7270_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:55:53.493Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eRegarding resetting chats so that the whole previous context isn’t always being sent, to avoid token burn, this is the advice being given:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003caside class=\"quote group-CursorStaff\" data-username=\"mohitjain\" data-display-name=\"Mohit\" data-post=\"13\" data-topic=\"171221\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"quote-controls\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cimg alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea3.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/mohitjain/48/100229_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://forum.cursor.com/t/grok-bot-ultra-users-how-do-you-make-the-weekly-allowance-last-mine-reached-99-in-three-days/171221/13\"\u003eGrok Bot Ultra users: how do you make the weekly allowance last? Mine reached 99% in three days\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003estart a fresh chat with the bot (the + you found) for each new task\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBut this isn’t an option on mobile (at least Android).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHow are we meant to reset or start a new chat with the bot?\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-14T06:23:29.557Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":2,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":11.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":171567,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-unable-to-start-new-chat-on-mobile","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":3,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://forum.cursor.com/t/grok-bot-ultra-users-how-do-you-make-the-weekly-allowance-last-mine-reached-99-in-three-days/171221/13","internal":true,"reflection":false,"title":"Grok Bot Ultra users: how do you make the weekly allowance last? Mine reached 99% in three days","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":989,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-unable-to-start-new-chat-on-mobile/171567/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":490469,"name":"Mohit","username":"mohitjain","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/mohitjain/{size}/100229_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-14T06:40:02.266Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/mwjt42\"\u003e@mwjt42\u003c/a\u003e,  That “+” trick is desktop-only right now. The Android “+” just has New Bot and New Group Chat (which needs two bots), so there’s no one-bot fresh-chat option on mobile yet. We’ve passed it along.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you’re ever on the desktop app, right-click the bot and choose Duplicate. You get a copy with an empty chat that keeps the bot’s setup, and it shows up on your phone too.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd no need to reset to save usage. Idle chats don’t cost anything. Usage only counts when you send a new message, so just start fresh per task and leave the old chats be.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":7,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-14T06:40:02.266Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":11.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":171567,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-unable-to-s